{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1912d46a-869f-5f2f-9e8a-4dd70c66adee", "source_ordinal": 3199, "reading_ordinal": 853, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "别想骗我", "published_at": "2021-07-17T01:15:12+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/471900217/answer/2002754605"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这道理很朴素——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不管是谁，公开主张不支持分裂中国的恐怖活动，中国老百姓都会支持，也没有任何理由不支持。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "ta过去做了相反的事，那些事该追究继续追究，对支持ta现在的态度无影响。", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "ta将来说了不该支持的话，那就在ta将来说了这些话后不支持，对支持ta现在的态度无影响。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "ta说了结果将来没有做，那就将来不支持，对支持ta现在的态度无影响。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 169}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "对认可和鼓励ta人的善意设立各种各样的门槛，不管你自以为这门槛有多么“合理”，都是一种显而易见的更糟糕的实践。", "char_start": 171, "char_end": 226}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "对外交往的处理机制其实极其简单——不管任何前提，对我希望看到的改变都立刻报以奖励；不管任何前提，对我反对的改变都立刻报以抗议。", "char_start": 227, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "对方两件同时做，那么我们的支持与抗议就同时做。", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 314}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "小孩子们自己的本能是什么呢？", "char_start": 315, "char_end": 329}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "自认为“友好”的时候，对自己反对的事情就不抗议。", "char_start": 330, "char_end": 354}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "自认为“不友好”的时候，对自己期待的事情也不支持。", "char_start": 355, "char_end": 380}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "自以为这叫“稳重”，叫“立场坚定”，叫“恩怨分明”。", "char_start": 381, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "事实上这必定会导致对“朋友”一路忍让宽纵，直到最后彻底翻脸——翻脸概率近乎百分之一百。", "char_start": 408, "char_end": 451}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你没抗议，人家为啥要自行脑补你不高兴？你不高兴你不说，到了后来算总账，你自以为这叫“友好”，其实这不过是一种缺少表达自信、缺少对友谊的最低信心，用“宽容”这样的美好词汇遮掩的懒惰和懦弱的逃避。", "char_start": 452, "char_end": 548}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "而一旦“翻脸”，人家想要和解又事实的难如登天。光表示支持和友善就不够了，还要伴手礼，还要鞠躬道歉，还要真诚流泪，还要一切能彻底融化你的心的绝对诚意。", "char_start": 549, "char_end": 623}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "否则就都是“假的”，不能相信，不能“上当”。", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 646}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "执行的净结果是，至少有相当一部分人和解失败。", "char_start": 647, "char_end": 669}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "综合起来是什么结果呢？", "char_start": 670, "char_end": 681}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "翻脸极其容易，和解则不成比例的困难。", "char_start": 682, "char_end": 700}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "为什么说这是幼稚心态？", "char_start": 702, "char_end": 713}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "因为在父母、学校的荫蔽之下，小孩子们以为人际关系可以以这样奢侈的方式运转。", "char_start": 714, "char_end": 751}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "可以走“让我有任何意义不爽的人，求和我也不理ta”的路线。", "char_start": 752, "char_end": 781}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "可以走“想得到我的友好没那么简单”的路线。", "char_start": 782, "char_end": 803}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "将来你走上社会，不是你可以靠父母，而是父母配偶子女都要靠你的时候，你自己体会一下你能不能这么玩，你就明白了。", "char_start": 804, "char_end": 858}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "左手打归左手打，右手握归右手握。你跟人的关系永远处在边打边和的混合态，而且你把只要还有一点合作可能的状态都定义为非敌对状态，这才是成年人的正常态、健康态。", "char_start": 859, "char_end": 936}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "不要幻想靠“谁都害怕你无限的记仇和报复而不敢不和你保持友好”这种蠢到不可名状的迷信来“保证所有人不敢不友好”。", "char_start": 937, "char_end": 992}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "而要靠“极其不容易转向彼此仇恨，而极其容易转向和解”的机制去保证所有关系尽可能的良性。", "char_start": 993, "char_end": 1036}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "否则，不论你自认为有多强多霸道，你迟早垮台。", "char_start": 1037, "char_end": 1059}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 31}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0143"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么最近部分网络舆论存在支持塔利班的倾向？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028"], "summary": "围绕“别想骗我”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这道理很朴素——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这道理很朴素——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a876ad35-7464-5ae0-a820-c44792812c90", "source_ordinal": 3198, "reading_ordinal": 854, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "帝国坟场", "published_at": "2021-07-17T07:40:13+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/466753309/answer/2002890085"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "阿富汗是“帝国坟场”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "如果以美国现在这种程度的挫败就算一次“帝国埋葬”的话，", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 39}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "阿富汗作为帝国坟场完成的“帝国埋葬”怕还没有中国的零头多。", "char_start": 40, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "在全世界可能连前十名也挤不进去。", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 86}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 4}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0143"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：中文互联网上，阿富汗号称「帝国坟场」。如何征服阿富汗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004"], "summary": "围绕“帝国坟场”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“阿富汗是“帝国坟场”？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "阿富汗是“帝国坟场”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "12027641-d5f4-522c-801e-696c88b7e0fd", "source_ordinal": 3197, "reading_ordinal": 855, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "真实的颜值", "published_at": "2021-07-18T12:24:25+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/458577474/answer/2005080265"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个是个非常妙的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "镜像和真实的样子有几大差异：", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）距离差异。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 34}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "大部分人看到你时的距离，并不见得是镜子和你之间的距离。对演员尤其如此——大部分的观众都在台下，离着若干米远。或者离着机位——大部分特写镜头都不是把相机真的放得很近，而是用长焦拉近的。", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "所以明星从镜子里看到的自己，和观众从剧场、镜头里看到的ta是不一样的。", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "不要小看这个距离因素，离得远看你和离得近看你得到的观感是不同的。比如离得不够近，可能看不出眉毛是画的哦。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "2）镜子本身的变形效应。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "镜子并不见得是理想反射，有些镜子是动过手脚的。最典型的就是卖场里的落地穿衣镜，往往会向上倾斜个几度，会很明显的突出修长感。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果是卖场提供的固定的镜子，你自己最好注点意。", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 314}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "3）镜子所在的位置往往有特别设计的光照条件。", "char_start": 315, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这个典型的就是化妆镜了。", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "问题是其他人看到你的时候可是不见得有这些照明的。", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 375}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "4）人面对镜子会不自觉的调整表情神态。", "char_start": 376, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "人一看镜子，就会无意识的自我调整。又是展肩收腹、又是挺腰拔背。", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 427}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "而且表情肃穆温和，温文尔雅。", "char_start": 428, "char_end": 442}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "简直仪态万方。", "char_start": 443, "char_end": 450}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "其实跟人一说话一得意，二郎腿就跷上来了，啤酒肚也鼓起来了，背也驼下去了，后槽牙笑出来了，不自知的歪眉斜眼，都出来了。", "char_start": 451, "char_end": 509}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这些会让你完全变成另外一个样子，这也是别人眼里你最日常的样子。", "char_start": 510, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这个，你啥时候有机会调一下监控录像，看一下自己的真实表现，你会吓一跳——你可能会对放出来的声音都感到惊讶。", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 595}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "5）自己看自己，和别人看你自己，带着的感情滤镜不一致。", "char_start": 596, "char_end": 623}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "正所谓“情人眼里出西施”，你的观众对你的感情倾向会极大的影响到ta们的大脑对你的相貌的分析和解读。", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 673}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "有正面看法的话，即使是黄渤王宝强那样的，也一样会看出帅气、坚毅、善良、憨厚、阳刚什么的来。有负面看法的话，即使是范冰冰、章子怡那样的，也可以看出“做作”、“狐媚”、“虚假”来。", "char_start": 674, "char_end": 762}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "某种程度上，人成功到一定的程度，ta们的长相会重新定义和修正美的定义，比如周恩来、毛润之。这种效应本质上就是从人的“感情滤镜”里来的。", "char_start": 763, "char_end": 830}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "换句话来说，有多少人爱你，有多少人相信你的爱，对于ta们眼里看到的、心里记住的你的音容形貌有极大的影响。", "char_start": 831, "char_end": 883}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "而你自己在看镜子的时候的心态和这个就相去甚远了——大体上，你还是觉得自己挺不错的。", "char_start": 884, "char_end": 925}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "到底哪一个才是“真实的样子”，是镜子里的那个，还是平常从别人眼里看见的那个，这本身就是个哲学问题。", "char_start": 927, "char_end": 976}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "但是你既然这样问了，显然你的答案你不是前者了。", "char_start": 977, "char_end": 1000}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 28}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0143"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：镜子中的样子是不是自己真实的颜值？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027"], "summary": "围绕“真实的颜值”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个是个非常妙的问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个是个非常妙的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "550d38d4-31b2-56d8-bc6e-8699b1cdbcb6", "source_ordinal": 3196, "reading_ordinal": 856, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "烦躁", "published_at": "2021-07-18T14:36:48+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/20021937/answer/2005292053"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "烦躁是有结构的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你可以把它理解为一种“情绪波的叠加”。不同周期、振幅的波互相叠加，对你产生负面情绪的浪头。", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 54}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "有些只淹到你的肚脐眼，你没有任何特别的感觉。", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "有些淹到你的胸口，你觉得闷闷的。", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "有些淹到你的鼻子，你无法呼吸。", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 110}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "有的淹到你的头顶，你眼前一片黑暗。", "char_start": 111, "char_end": 128}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "要技术性的对付这些波动，就要想方设法的看清楚当前的状况，好采取针对性的策略。", "char_start": 129, "char_end": 167}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "是什么样的震源在什么地方造成什么幅度、什么速度的波？它的前锋将在何处抵达你的位置？1号波与2号波的高潮是否会同时抵达？一号波会持续多久过境？而二号波会持续多久过境？", "char_start": 168, "char_end": 250}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "一号波而二号波的高潮交会点（T1-2）会走过一条什么样的路径？你是否在T1-2的行经路径上？", "char_start": 251, "char_end": 297}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "T1-3呢？T2-3呢？", "char_start": 298, "char_end": 310}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "所谓技术性的处理，就是你其实可以通过对近处的若干信号的检测，去掌握这些信息，然后选择自己的策略。是直接打时间差不断的灵活变换站位避开叠加点，还是仗着某些波动的一过性和短期性憋住气等它从头顶过去。", "char_start": 312, "char_end": 409}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "如果你有这个意识，你会看到技术性的处理是完全可能的。你只是要建立起这个预警系统，开始积累数据和形成算法。就像人类建立起天气预报系统那样。", "char_start": 410, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这在方法论上如何完成，你们可以去了解一下天气预报系统是怎么从觉得“完全不可能，全靠烧香贴符”，到“建立数据检测和计算机模拟算法”的历史过程，可以参考一下它是怎么做的。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 562}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "但这是技术性的方面，它显而易见的只能帮助你在局部的，眼前的危机面前，凭借你手边的资源求得一个战术性的结果。也就是你已经进入风暴了，它可以帮你提高一点幸存的概率。", "char_start": 563, "char_end": 643}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你更应该关心的是战略性的方面。", "char_start": 645, "char_end": 660}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "首先是战略侦察。", "char_start": 661, "char_end": 669}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "不是去观察你自己最近几个月周边发生的事情，而是去观察千百万年来整个人类周边发生的事情，观察现在正在整个国家，整个人类正在发生的事情。", "char_start": 670, "char_end": 736}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "前者只是浪，后者则是潮。浪可以躲，可以扛，潮是没法躲、没法扛的。", "char_start": 737, "char_end": 769}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "第二，是增强战略布局。", "char_start": 771, "char_end": 782}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "浪头来了，你抱紧某些石头是可以顶过去的，甚至抱紧石头会是一个好策略。潮水来了，抱着某些石头不放就是自杀行为了。", "char_start": 783, "char_end": 838}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "石头还是要抱，但是要换一些石头抱。抱错了，负面情绪的频度、烈度和趋势可以活埋了你。", "char_start": 839, "char_end": 880}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "找到可以抱的石头，这是首要的战略布局。", "char_start": 881, "char_end": 900}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "第二个，就是筑造防波堤。也就是身边要有有爱的能力且爱你的人。", "char_start": 901, "char_end": 931}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "爱有天然的帮助身边人缓冲分担冲击的能力。无论是什么样的浪潮，爱你且有爱的能力的人都可以将它们分割切碎，转变成细碎的泡沫。", "char_start": 932, "char_end": 992}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这里“有爱的能力”是至关重要的要素。", "char_start": 994, "char_end": 1012}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "没有爱的能力，空有爱的表态，不但没有任何实际意义，而且反而常常要造成情绪上的进一步激化。", "char_start": 1013, "char_end": 1057}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "第三，是要积累战略资产。", "char_start": 1059, "char_end": 1071}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "战略资产主要是指时间的控制权和空间的控制权。", "char_start": 1072, "char_end": 1094}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "“躲波峰”是一款不折不扣的时间和空间的游戏。你能移动，能修正你的时间节奏，是你能最大程度的控制情绪的战略资源。", "char_start": 1095, "char_end": 1150}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "举点最朴素的例子——你刚好生理期，却又恰好要上台，你没有余地重新安排时间，你就会刚好硬顶两个浪头的叠加，对你的挑战就加倍的巨大。你如果有能力改变这些安排，你自然会减少很多风险和痛苦。", "char_start": 1151, "char_end": 1242}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "可以自由支配的时间和空间，是你躲闪和错开这些情绪波叠加的基本资源，这对你有不可替代的战略性意义。", "char_start": 1243, "char_end": 1291}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "所以，如果你选择极其不灵活的时间表（比如同时打三份工）的前提，必须是你周围有非常严密的防波堤（譬如大量的朋友、高度和睦的家庭），否则稍有波动就会直接硬撞。", "char_start": 1292, "char_end": 1369}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "而你失去了情绪平衡是一定会丧失有效性的。无论你的完美计划指向什么样的美好目标，都没有意义。", "char_start": 1370, "char_end": 1415}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "就像再美好的目标对一辆发动机停机的汽车来说都没有意义一样。", "char_start": 1416, "char_end": 1445}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "同样的，如果你没有可以完全由自己掌握的空间——也就是隐私空间——那么你也会发现同样的问题。", "char_start": 1446, "char_end": 1491}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "自主的时间和空间，就是人控制自己情绪的战略资源，是这个战场上的子弹和石油。你不能把它们都拿来交换别的东西，尤其是不能把它们都交换成无法再重新兑换成时间和空间自由的东西。", "char_start": 1492, "char_end": 1576}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "举个例子，你可以拿它们去换钱，但是钱往往可以重新兑换成自由的时间和空间——注意，这不是没有损耗的。那么在这个前提下，换钱还不算是完全失败的策略。", "char_start": 1577, "char_end": 1649}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "但如果你换到了钱就花掉了，或者换成了无法再兑换成时间和空间的东西，那么你管理情绪的资源就会受到净损失。", "char_start": 1650, "char_end": 1701}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "长此以往，你的情绪控制能力就会天然的因为没有资源而消灭。", "char_start": 1702, "char_end": 1730}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "谁会想和一个情绪长期负面、失控的人长期共处？", "char_start": 1732, "char_end": 1754}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "就算想，谁能？", "char_start": 1755, "char_end": 1762}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "这些原理，父母们自己也要仔细想好。留给子女你不能进入的空间和你不能侵入的时间，是有必要的。那是ta们“躲浪头”的本钱。", "char_start": 1764, "char_end": 1823}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "不给躲，ta们可能会没得选了。", "char_start": 1824, "char_end": 1839}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2021-07/18/01643dad90fc55859657c7ff26398890.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2021-07/18/d5dcb2aaf4b5bb3feaf98b5f3a7c556d.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 50, "image": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0143"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：心情烦躁时怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043"], "summary": "围绕“烦躁”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“烦躁是有结构的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "烦躁是有结构的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "85ee0565-2d16-566b-affb-8319e018eb62", "source_ordinal": 3195, "reading_ordinal": 857, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "长时间保持理性", "published_at": "2021-07-18T21:50:43+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/472990856/answer/2005970659"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个真的很直白的，因为人是一种特别简单的动物，干什么事情得了好处，就一直干；干了得了坏处，那就干得勉强，最后放弃。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "如何长时间的保持理性？主要就是吃足了不理性的亏，尝了理性的甜头，那就自然长期保持理性了。如果不理性体验反而特别好，理性反而很倒霉，整天翻来覆去，那就保持不了了。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 138}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那这种转变的关键是什么呢？是看你是靠人养，还是得你养人。你靠人养，你会发现不理性很占便宜的——越是不理性，体现出理性能力的无能，反而越是不会被安排承担什么责任、分担什么风险；越是理性，反而越是被分配任务，越是被挑剔做得不够好。还会出现很多人来跟你“讲道理”，试图科学的证明你是错的，你还不能不接着。然后你如果讲道理的话，你还真的很可能经常被说得无话可说，按理就得放弃或者改变计划。", "char_start": 139, "char_end": 329}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果你索性往地上一滚，不嘛不嘛我就不——没准还啥都有了。但这些到没有人养你、只有你养人的时候就全变了——养自己也得养啊。你敢往地上躺，就有人敢收你的尸，滚都没机会滚。没有人会兜着你不理性的任何后果，每一滴都得你兜着——哦不，除了自己那份，你还得兜着一圈在地上打滚的、放弃自己的理性的老小孩、小小孩们所造成的后果。那时候你不理性你都睡不着觉，这时你就完全不用操心“如何长时间的保持理性”。", "char_start": 330, "char_end": 523}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "综上——长期保持理性只有一个条件，就是你是不是有爱的义务或者有爱的追求。因为爱就是少添麻烦多解决问题，就是养人而少要人养。", "char_start": 524, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "没有理性，即爱无能。这个辉瑞也治不好。", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 605}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 6}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0143"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何长时间保持理性？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“长时间保持理性”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个真的很直白的，因为人是一种特别简单的动物，干什么事情得了好处，就一直干；干了得了坏处，那就干得勉强，最后放弃。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个真的很直白的，因为人是一种特别简单的动物，干什么事情得了好处，就一直干；干了得了坏处，那就干得勉强，最后放弃。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 57, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f4e45ae2-7ecb-5920-ad1b-d924396a1526", "source_ordinal": 3194, "reading_ordinal": 858, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "偶像这种毒", "published_at": "2021-07-19T00:43:49+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/473026941/answer/2006231403"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "世界上最蠢的行为，就是追求当偶像。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "当了偶像，基本上属于人的一切都跟你没啥关系了。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "不要指望当了偶像还能有正常的爱，也不要指望当了偶像还能有什么健康的快乐。因为一个人对另一个人可以有的最坏的态度，就是偶像崇拜。这态度里的需求，绝不是人类可能满足的；而因不能满足转向仇恨的速度之快、程度之深，也绝非人类可以承受的。", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而且这种险恶还有千倍万倍，在你根本不能察觉和预料的地方悄然生长。", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "追求当一个偶像，是人可以有的最坏的志向。", "char_start": 191, "char_end": 211}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "引诱人当一个偶像，是对人最坏的诅咒。", "char_start": 212, "char_end": 230}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "当一个偶像，是人能有的最大的愚蠢。", "char_start": 231, "char_end": 248}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "做了偶像，这类矢志不渝的毁灭行为是注定要发生的。具体的指控是不是真实的，根本就不会改变最后注定的结果。因为如果那是不真实的，你只是逃脱了人类的法律。", "char_start": 250, "char_end": 324}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "总还会有下一个崇拜者走另一条路线来做另一次刺杀。", "char_start": 325, "char_end": 349}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为“崇拜了你、祭献了你，却没有满足”的仇恨，是唯有“毁灭你”才能终止的。", "char_start": 350, "char_end": 387}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这是自然法在运用它自己不容抵挡的力量在惩治偶像崇拜这种天然的罪，真正的罪在你追求当偶像的时候就已经犯下了。", "char_start": 388, "char_end": 441}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "自然法自动执行，不死不休。", "char_start": 442, "char_end": 455}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "所以，如果你没有能力得到别人的崇拜，这就先不说了，恭喜你，至少你不用担心这种危险了。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 499}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "如果你有机会、有条件得到别人的崇拜，那么你说话做事的时候要像处理氢氟酸一样地小心。", "char_start": 500, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "敢于诱导和笑纳人的崇拜，跟往手上倒氢氟酸没有区别。", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 567}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "查一查那是什么后果。", "char_start": 568, "char_end": 578}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这个世界上有很多事，只要做了就难免有被人当偶像的危险。比如去当领袖、去当世界冠军、去当科学家、去当特种兵。", "char_start": 580, "char_end": 633}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你一定要记清楚——只有是出于“宁可粉身碎骨、万劫不复也要做成这些事”的爱，才值得你去冒这种险。", "char_start": 634, "char_end": 681}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这是绝对的风险，而绝不是什么让人羡慕的荣耀与福利。", "char_start": 682, "char_end": 707}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "只有对此有绝对清醒的认识、而且时时刻刻如同看待氢氟酸一样防止被偶像崇拜的人，才有可能得到宽免，不死于这种生产事故。", "char_start": 708, "char_end": 765}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "记住了，归荣耀于自己，而且还刻意追求让别人产生这种观点，是一种极端危险的自杀行为。", "char_start": 766, "char_end": 807}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "只有极力避免后仍然客观残留的那部分是可以被自然法勉强宽容的。", "char_start": 808, "char_end": 838}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你一直要记得，你为什么、为谁要来冒这个风险。", "char_start": 839, "char_end": 861}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0143"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待都美竹再次曝光吴亦凡劣迹，称「可送你十年牢饭」，要求其退出中国娱乐圈，并致歉公示 3 天？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“偶像这种毒”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“世界上最蠢的行为，就是追求当偶像。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "世界上最蠢的行为，就是追求当偶像。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b5744f29-b95b-5ab0-abb3-e62f8d8d0dac", "source_ordinal": 3193, "reading_ordinal": 859, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "小县城的未来", "published_at": "2021-07-19T03:27:07+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/263564254/answer/2006330827"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "当然会有。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "很多人在苦于“县级市地方势力盘根错节”，以此为理由觉得绝望。", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这未免太看的起“地方势力”了。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "想要一手遮天，有个前提条件就是地方的封闭性大到足够上面有信息障碍。而这种封闭性的前提是能控制内部信息的不外泄。", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果县里只有一条国道过境，一共就三班班车到省城，谁也没有车，谁也没有电话，谁也没有外地亲属，而且县城官员没有空降、没有轮岗、没有与省地的密切公务来往、并且有很大的自主性的人事任免权，那还有点可能。", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但现在是这样的状态吗？", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "在大数据、高速路网、高铁到县的时代，如果它们导致了地方经济或者社会秩序上的问题，无论是要查找、还是要拆解这点“盘根错节”并没有什么大不了的困难。那些县有风险性较高的人事结构、政商关系、账户往来甚至车辆往来，人工智能分分钟高亮出来给你看，还能用自然语言给你一份带着各种加重号的流畅报告。", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 362}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "至于说什么“离了某家某户，县里就会没法运转”之类的话，现在说出来ta们自己信吗？", "char_start": 363, "char_end": 403}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "中国有2846个县，这些县里人口总数12.8亿。", "char_start": 404, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你觉得中国能接受它们“没希望”吗？", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 446}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "个人在没有行政系统内的基本经验的时候容易胡思乱想，很容易就会觉得世界一片黑暗，完了完了，因为自己个人“想不到什么办法”。", "char_start": 447, "char_end": 507}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "但根据这种个人的悲观去预言手握人类史上空前的资金和技术能力的中国政府也没有办法，以至于要得出“没有希望”的结论……这真的是太过于荒谬了。", "char_start": 508, "char_end": 576}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "县城何止“有希望”，甚至还是价值洼地、未来的热点好吗？", "char_start": 577, "char_end": 604}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "如果你真有创业应有的准备，大城市的条件未必真比县里好。", "char_start": 605, "char_end": 632}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你在xx县，并不影响你做全国甚至全球市场，也并不影响你去招股、融资。投资人并不会因为你的厂或者总部在某县级市就低看你一眼。", "char_start": 633, "char_end": 694}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "甚至还可能因为你在某县高看你好吗？", "char_start": 695, "char_end": 712}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "太仓、诸暨、义乌、萧山……这也都是县或者前不久是县级市好吗？", "char_start": 713, "char_end": 743}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这是哪？", "char_start": 745, "char_end": 749}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "贵州兴义市——贵州的县级市。", "char_start": 750, "char_end": 764}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2021-07/18/25b340bc8794783c0938a2b5961401ba.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2021-07/18/1cddfa4f2ebc30ed139e47b15f2d72bd.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22, "image": 2}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0143"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：中国的小县城会有未来么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“小县城的未来”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“当然会有。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "当然会有。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "589496e2-1538-5d4d-a132-42730486c25f", "source_ordinal": 3192, "reading_ordinal": 860, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "第一毒", "published_at": "2021-07-19T09:51:13+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/cc3709eee83311ebbad452540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "世界上最蠢的行为，就是追求当偶像。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "当了偶像，基本上属于人的一切都跟你没啥关系了。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "不要指望当了偶像还能有正常的爱，也不要指望当了偶像还能有什么健康的快乐。因为一个人对另一个人可以有的最坏的态度，就是偶像崇拜。这态度里的需求，绝不是人类可能满足的，而因不能满足转向仇恨之快、之深，也绝非人类可以承受的。", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 151}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而且这种险恶还有千倍万倍，在你根本不能察觉和预料的地方悄然生长。", "char_start": 152, "char_end": 184}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "追求当一个偶像，是人可以有的最坏的志向。", "char_start": 185, "char_end": 205}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "引诱人当一个偶像，是对人最坏的诅咒。", "char_start": 206, "char_end": 224}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "当一个偶像，是人能有的最大的愚蠢。", "char_start": 225, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "做了偶像，这类矢志不渝的毁灭行为是注定要发生的。具体的指控是不是真实的，根本就不会改变最后注定的结果。因为如果那是不真实的，你只是逃脱了人类的法律。", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 317}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "总还会有下一个崇拜者走另一条路线来做另一次刺杀。", "char_start": 318, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为“崇拜了你、祭献了你，却没有满足”的仇恨，是唯有毁灭你才能终止的。这是自然法在运用它自己不容抵挡的力量在惩治偶像崇拜这种天然的罪，真正的罪在你追求当偶像的时候就已经犯下了。", "char_start": 343, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "自然法自动执行，不死不休。", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 445}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所以，如果你没有能力得到别人的崇拜，这就先不说了，恭喜你，至少你不用担心这种危险了。", "char_start": 446, "char_end": 488}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "如果你有机会、有条件得到别人的崇拜，那么你说话做事的时候要像处理氢氟酸一样的小心。", "char_start": 489, "char_end": 530}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "敢于诱导和笑纳人的崇拜，跟往手上倒氢氟酸没有区别。", "char_start": 531, "char_end": 556}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "查一查那是什么后果。", "char_start": 557, "char_end": 567}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这个世界上有很多事，只要做了就难免有被人当偶像的危险。比如去当领袖、去当世界冠军、去当科学家、去当特种兵。你一定要记清楚——只有是出于宁可粉身碎骨、万劫不复也要做成这些事的爱，才值得你去冒这种险。", "char_start": 568, "char_end": 666}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这是绝对的风险，而绝不是什么让人羡慕的荣耀与福利。", "char_start": 667, "char_end": 692}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "只有对此有绝对清醒的认识、而且时时刻刻如同看待氢氟酸一样防止被偶像崇拜的人，有可能得到宽免，不死于这种生产事故。", "char_start": 693, "char_end": 749}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "记住了，归荣耀于自己，而且还追求让别人产生这种观点，是一种极端危险的自杀行为。", "char_start": 750, "char_end": 789}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "只有极力避免后仍然客观残留的那部分是可以被自然法勉强宽容的。", "char_start": 790, "char_end": 820}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你一直要记得，你为什么、为谁要来冒这个风险。", "char_start": 821, "char_end": 843}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0143"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：偶像这种毒；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“第一毒”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“世界上最蠢的行为，就是追求当偶像。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "世界上最蠢的行为，就是追求当偶像。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
